emistry test yeah luckily their  chemistry was not an issue at all as we  get to see in their romance on screen  thank goodness for amazing creative  instagram profiles  number three who's that on the street it  might just be a star angus cloud was  minding his own business walking down a  street in new york when a casting rep  laid eyes on him this kind of thing  doesn't happen every day so it made  sense that cloud was suspicious and  worried he was being scammed until he  said yes and made a tape for the  creative team taking liberties to change  bits in the room to suit how he'd play  the character and it was perfect the  casting director knew he was 100 there  already in terms of pez's character so  it's no surprise that after the callback  session the actor was flown to la to  shoot  not having any experience cloud actually  resorted to some youtube acting  tutorials on the flight over but at the  end of it imma just show up and do what  they want and then be done clearly this  method works  number four  the first time around sweeney rejected  her euphoria audition after learning the  character would need to appear topless  the actress decided it wasn't the job  for her because i was too nervous to do  it the casting team didn't let the  rejection knock them down though and  tried sweeney again and thank goodness  she gave it a shot i fell in love with  the rawness and the situations and the  emotions levinson sweetened the deal  sharing what the character had ahead  when he told me her arc i absolutely  fell in love  sometimes fate has a way of working out  number five  seven auditions later barbie joined the  euphoria fam her first major role was  definitely a good one i'm reading the  sides which is like you know one scene  and i'm like even the way she talks is  very similar to me the audition came  through her agent and she was keen but  working as a model for so many years  left her worried that people would have  a hard time taking her seriously as an  