inding her instagram  page sam levinson was intrigued and the  casting agency worked to convince cherry  to audition he just thought i was funny  hey if it works it works to see it all  close up is just so incredible  number 12  from the background to the foreground  there is no stopping this up-and-comer  rebecca louise was hanging out in the  euphoria set working as an extra when  she got bumped up to a speaking role a  dream come true for sure to make the  deal even sweeter her first day on set  was finished off with a fist bump and  compliments from zendaya herself just  goes to show you never really know how  close you are to your dreams becoming a  reality  this cast is something special luckily  the creative team didn't stop trying to  find the best of the best no matter how  unusual the method they used who says  you can't find a star off the street

